{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And you shall do My statutes and keep My ordinances</b> — He admonishes regarding the statutes on account of shemittah and the jubilee that have been mentioned, for they are included among the statutes; and the ordinances, on account of the law of the return of sales and slaves in the jubilee and of overreaching. And He said, \"and you shall dwell on the land securely,\" for through the sin of shemittah and jubilee Israel is exiled (Avot 5:9). And He returned and said, \"and the land shall give its fruit, etc., and you shall dwell securely upon it\" (Leviticus 25:19), that you shall not need to go out from it in the seventh year to sojourn in another land because of lack of bread:"], :book :leviticus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:59:55.781049780Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}